<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>消息已发送</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .notice {
      background-color: #ecfdf3;
      border: 1px solid #86efac;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 12px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      padding-top: 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #6b7280;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>你的消息已发送</h1>

  <p>你的 失联告警 · LastSignal 消息已发送给收件人。</p>

  <div class="notice">
    <strong>发送时间：</strong> <%= @delivered_at&.strftime("%Y-%m-%d %H:%M UTC") || "刚刚" %>
  </div>

  <% if @recipient_emails.any? %>
    <p><strong>已通知收件人：</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <% @recipient_emails.each do |email| %>
        <li><%= email %></li>
      <% end %>
    </ul>
  <% end %>

  <div class="footer">
    <p>此邮件由 <%= @app_name %> 自动发送。</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
